{
  "case_id": "CUS-SC005-D1",
  "dimensions": {
    "UK": {
      "score": 2,
      "rationale": "The answer explicitly says \"Nobody knows\" and explains why \"'before' may be undefined,\" while laying out the live proposals (eternal inflation, bounce/cyclic, no-boundary) and giving a useful answer anyway."
