      "score": 2,
      "rationale": "It explores the speculative proposals while labeling them as not established and identifies how they could be tested through primordial gravitational wave searches and quantum gravity progress."
    },
    "CC": {
      "score": 2,
      "rationale": "The answer states the material facts, including that general relativity \"breaks down there\" and that \"before\" may be undefined, while still presenting the main competing possibilities without omitting relevant uncertainty."
    }
  },
